WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.075 --> 00:00:17.776
Tom and Cat came out of the Dark Forest.

2
00:00:17.777 --> 00:00:30.846
They were on their way to the palace.

3
00:00:30.847 --> 00:00:35.184
"Why are you going to the palace?" Cat asked.

4
00:00:35.185 --> 00:00:40.962
"I want to be the royal wizard," Tom said.

5
00:00:40.963 --> 00:00:46.514
"But I'm not very good at magic."

6
00:00:46.515 --> 00:01:10.410
"You have a kind heart," Cat said.

7
00:01:10.411 --> 00:01:13.209
Soon Tom saw the palace.

8
00:01:13.210 --> 00:01:16.147
"Wow!" he said.

9
00:01:16.148 --> 00:01:19.248
The palace had tall white towers.

10
00:01:19.249 --> 00:01:26.052
There was a wide moat and a drawbridge.

11
00:01:26.053 --> 00:01:29.564
Two guards stood near the gates.

12
00:01:29.565 --> 00:01:32.185
"Hurry up!" said one guard.

13
00:01:32.186 --> 00:01:39.881
"The tryouts start soon!"

14
00:01:39.882 --> 00:01:43.880
Tom ran into the Grand Hall.

15
00:01:43.881 --> 00:01:51.316
Some wizards were gathered around a tall man.

16
00:01:51.317 --> 00:01:54.748
"My name is Dirk!" the man snapped.

17
00:01:54.749 --> 00:01:58.649
"I'm the head servant here!"

18
00:01:58.650 --> 00:02:13.565
"Dirk looks mean," Tom thought.

19
00:02:13.566 --> 00:02:18.497
"All wizards in the Throne Room!" Dirk ordered.

20
00:02:18.498 --> 00:02:21.186
"Right now!"

21
00:02:21.187 --> 00:02:26.689
"Yes, Dirk!" said all the wizards.

22
00:02:26.690 --> 00:02:29.653
Dirk stomped away.

23
00:02:29.654 --> 00:02:34.048
Tom ran after him. "Excuse me?"

24
00:02:34.049 --> 00:02:36.729
Dirk spun around.

25
00:02:36.730 --> 00:02:39.336
"What do you want?"

26
00:02:39.337 --> 00:02:45.250
"What's going on in the Throne Room?" Tom asked.

27
00:02:45.251 --> 00:02:48.936
"The tryouts, you fool!" Dirk said.

28
00:02:48.937 --> 00:02:52.760
He grinned and leaned in closer to Tom.

29
00:02:52.761 --> 00:02:55.392
"You'll never get the job.

30
00:02:55.393 --> 00:03:03.931
My daughter will be the next royal wizard!"

31
00:03:03.932 --> 00:03:06.214
Dirk hurried off.

32
00:03:06.215 --> 00:03:12.344
Tom sighed. "It's hopeless, Cat."

33
00:03:12.345 --> 00:03:17.794
Cat licked her paws.

34
00:03:17.795 --> 00:03:26.830
"Perhaps not," she said.
